flowchart TB
  E[Agent/Tool/Session Events] --> P[Deterministic Policies]
  E --> I[Read-only Inspector]
  P --> D{Anomaly?}
  I --> D
  D -->|no| C[Continue]
  D -->|yes| F[Freeze Controller]
  F --> X[Cancel active turn; keep inbox]
  F --> G[Pre-step reject]
  F --> TG[Write-tool guards deny]
  F --> IR[Inspection Report]
  IR --> S[Staff correction review]
  S -->|repair| R[Release with new order]
  S -->|untrusted| N[Replace Agent]
  S -->|strategic| GE[General]
